        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive Me Nutz is the ultimate pulse-pounding driving and racing playground—where every throttle twist, drift and daring stunt can make you famous… or land you in hot water with the cops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 Explore a Living City</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Districts: From neon-lit downtown streets to sun-baked industrial zones, each area feels alive with traffic, pedestrians and hidden shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Functional Traffic System: Stop at lights, yield to oncoming cars or risk a five-star chase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 Endless Race Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Circuit Races: Compete on procedurally generated tracks that keep you guessing — no two circuits are ever the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint Trials &amp; Trailblazers: Test your precision and timing as you blast from point to point under the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go-Kart Showdowns: Lightweight, nimble—and brilliantly chaotic when you bump opponents off the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 High-Stakes Police Pursuits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commit a traffic offense and the law goes Nutz:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Chase AI adjusts tactics based on your speed, route and recklessness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk vs. Reward: Evade capture , but one mistake will cost dearly or send you back to the station… and cost you time and money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Stunt &amp; Drift Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated Stunt Arena: Mount “The Hump,” Loop the loop, or duke it out in head-to-head jump races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 Build, Buy &amp; Customize</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of Vehicles: From pocket-sized karts to supercars that hit 500 km/h—each with unique handling and upgrade paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Customization: Tweak engines, suspension, handling, decals, paint and custom liveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage &amp; Repair: Push your ride to the limit, but remember: smash too hard and you’ll need a trip to the repair shop—fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 Test Your Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test Track: Hone your laps against ghost cars that mirror your personal best—always pushing you to improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Legal” Missions:  If you are busted a number of times you may be required to complete special &quot;re-training&quot; sessions. Swap the sirens for civility: complete objectives and time trials while obeying every traffic law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Real-World Physics, Crazy Fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our physics engine strikes the perfect balance between authentic handling and over-the-top thrills. Whether you’re carving hairpins in a kart or unleashing raw horsepower in a hypercar, Drive Me Nutz keeps your adrenaline—and bank account—on the rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s Next?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More city districts, wild stunt arenas, story-driven missions and ride-sharing challenges are all coming soon. Dive in now—and get ready to Drive You Nutz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive Me Nutz is the ultimate pulse-pounding driving and racing playground—where every throttle twist, drift and daring stunt can make you famous… or land you in hot water with the cops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 Explore a Living City</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Districts: From neon-lit downtown streets to sun-baked industrial zones, each area feels alive with traffic, pedestrians and hidden shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Functional Traffic System: Stop at lights, yield to oncoming cars or risk a five-star chase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 Endless Race Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Circuit Races: Compete on procedurally generated tracks that keep you guessing — no two circuits are ever the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint Trials &amp; Trailblazers: Test your precision and timing as you blast from point to point under the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go-Kart Showdowns: Lightweight, nimble—and brilliantly chaotic when you bump opponents off the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 High-Stakes Police Pursuits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commit a traffic offense and the law goes Nutz:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Chase AI adjusts tactics based on your speed, route and recklessness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk vs. Reward: Evade capture , but one mistake will cost dearly or send you back to the station… and cost you time and money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Stunt &amp; Drift Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated Stunt Arena: Mount “The Hump,” Loop the loop, or duke it out in head-to-head jump races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 Build, Buy &amp; Customize</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of Vehicles: From pocket-sized karts to supercars that hit 500 km/h—each with unique handling and upgrade paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Customization: Tweak engines, suspension, handling, decals, paint and custom liveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage &amp; Repair: Push your ride to the limit, but remember: smash too hard and you’ll need a trip to the repair shop—fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 Test Your Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test Track: Hone your laps against ghost cars that mirror your personal best—always pushing you to improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Legal” Missions:  If you are busted a number of times you may be required to complete special &quot;re-training&quot; sessions. Swap the sirens for civility: complete objectives and time trials while obeying every traffic law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Real-World Physics, Crazy Fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our physics engine strikes the perfect balance between authentic handling and over-the-top thrills. Whether you’re carving hairpins in a kart or unleashing raw horsepower in a hypercar, Drive Me Nutz keeps your adrenaline—and bank account—on the rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s Next?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More city districts, wild stunt arenas, story-driven missions and ride-sharing challenges are all coming soon. Dive in now—and get ready to Drive You Nutz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
